[[0,1167151,0,25,0,25,"2016-07-12T22:10:39","pickpock","",[],"","George Bush dances during Dallas Police memorial service","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MlC01CcHhF4","videos"],[1,5783956,0,4,0,4,"2016-07-12T22:42:18","Ivegotredditcancer","",[],"<p>Bush looks like that crazy neighbor who has a live in nurse to make sure he does not set himself on fire. </p>"],[1,5784028,0,2,0,2,"2016-07-12T22:51:02","AtheistComic","[e]",[],"<p>He's dancing on their graves! </p>"],[1,5784755,0,2,0,2,"2016-07-13T00:13:44","ThisIsCathartic","",[],"<p>That...is pretty interesting. </p>\n<p>He could be high/drunk, but it could also be old age. Or, it could be deliberate, or a combination of any or all of those things. </p>\n<p>Regardless, that summarized &quot;what the fuck&quot; for me in a whole new way. </p>"],[1,5785132,0,3,0,3,"2016-07-13T00:57:08","Lev-ice","",[],"<p>I don't see why it's a big deal, it's not like he was popping and locking. Seems like he was just trying ro lift some spirits and enjoying the song, but he's also George Bush.</p>"],[2,5787002,5785132,2,0,2,"2016-07-13T05:19:55","Camamoow","",[],"<p>To me it just looked like he was doing Church 'dancing' where you kind of shuffle awkwardly in place.\r\nWhich he probably does when he attends church, and listens to similar music.</p>"],[1,5785452,0,4,0,4,"2016-07-13T01:33:25","Dumb_Comment_Bot","",[],"<p>Last I heard he is pretty much completely senile and that was 2 years ago.</p>"],[2,5793419,5785452,1,0,1,"2016-07-13T21:37:01","Sciency","",[],"<p>Being completely shitfaced might explain this as well. </p>"]]
